      "problem": "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(x,w)=3{w}^{T}x-2\n$$\n\nthat maps two vectors to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the result \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)=x,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(3{w}^{T}x-2) \\\\  & =3\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-{∇}_{w}(2) \\\\  & =3\\cdot x+0 \\\\  & =3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
